- layouts/main-ports.json is Herdr 0.1.15's `main` layout (defaults/layouts/main.json), cloned with
  `layout.clone`, with the tab bar pointed at `tabs-ports` and a `ports` block added to the side panel.
- mods/tabs-ports/ is Herdr 0.1.15's `tabs` mod (defaults/mods/tabs), cloned with `mod.clone`.
  Every change is marked with a `// herdr-ports:` comment. Its window-button icons are Herdr's, unchanged.
